{"id":1094,"name":"Hatena☆Illusion","slug":"hatenaillusion","synopsis":"The series centers on Makoto Shiranui, a boy who travels to Tokyo seeking to become the apprentice of Mamoru Hoshisato, a world-famous magician and friend of his parents. Ever since he had watched a show by Mamoru and his wife Maive, he had dreamed of being a magician. Their daughter Kana (nicknamed Hatena) has been Makoto's friend since childhood. Even though Tokyo has had a rash of burglaries by a beautiful woman thief, Makoto can rest easy as long as Hatena is there. When he arrives at the Hoshisato residence, a haunted mansion, the family butler Jeeves and the maid Emma greet him, and he is reunited with Hatena, only to find out that they don't really get along now.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2020,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:53","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 02:56:37","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":35252},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":98515},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":13704},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":13037},{"site":"ANN","externalId":22390},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":8651},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2179,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/DjE14mvmjrIBqwdX1ROxqKa5CXXqhyVpqHVBlnF4.png"},{"id":2180,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/AZfTaH3or8QOgzEdKYxerxAVCqUNvmQcRHpYtGWG.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":213,"name":"Children's Playground Entertainment","slug":"childrens_playground_entertainment"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":9989,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":9990,"title":"Magic Words","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":11707,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":11903,"basename":"HatenaIllusion-OP1.webm","filename":"HatenaIllusion-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/HatenaIllusion